<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy June/July unleaded reformate.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy June/July unleaded reformate.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy unleaded 95-octane reformate cargoes for June 11-30 or July 1-15 delivery, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The cargoes are to be delivered to the ports of Keelung or Taichung.</p>
<p>The tender will close May 19 and will be valid for one day.</p>
<p>In its last tender which closed May 5, CPC purchased two unleaded 95-octane reformate cargoes for June 11-30 delivery at around $23.30 per barrel cost-and-freight Taiwan basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
